# Placeholder so `//go:embed all:webdist` always compiles on a fresh checkout.
#
# The real chat UI assets are produced and copied here by the official release
# build; a plain source `go build` embeds only this placeholder. Built assets are
# gitignored; only this placeholder is tracked.
#
# The dir is named "webdist" (not "dist") on purpose: the repo-root .gitignore
# ignores every directory named "dist", which would otherwise drop this file.
